# Play test of Skiff Shoal (CIPlay skiff_shoal, in a test world 'CI ...'): a sunken island, 14 m under the sea. No
# quest: down to the wreck, the skiff's chest. Points as in its recipe (heights over the island's own water line).
island Skiff Shoal
offset 0 0
expect animals Puffer fish 2
wait 3
kill Puffer fish
at 5.5 1.5 h=5
open The skiff's chest
